2. date: Convert the scheduled departure time from a mixed format (HH:mm) to ISO format (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssTZD).

3. numeric: Compare the actual departure time (if available) with the scheduled departure time for each flight, and check if the actual departure time is earlier than the scheduled one.

